   "text": "Key viva contrast \u2014 Fractional vs 0/1:\n- Fractional: greedy by ratio is OPTIMAL, O(n log n)\n- 0/1: greedy fails (all-or-nothing choice), needs DP, O(n*W)\nGreedy trap for 0/1: W=10, items (6kg,60) (6kg,60) (10kg,95)\n-> greedy gets 60, optimal is 95.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
